OL,3,GNEWSAWoman arrested after top-floor
OL,4,Aflat fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman has been arrested following a
OL,7,Ffire on the top floor of a block of
OL,8,Fflats in Weymouth early on Sunday
OL,9,Fmorning.
OL,11,FFirefighters in seven engines were sent
OL,12,Fto Keel House, Dorchester Road,
OL,13,FWeymouth, shortly before 01:00 BST
OL,14,Fwhere crews found a "well-developed"
OL,15,Ffire within a flat had spread to the
OL,16,Froof.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,334,330,200,160,0,100
