OL,3,GNEWSAWoman arrested after top-floor
OL,4,Aflat fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FDorset & Wiltshire Fire and Rescue said
OL,7,F30 firefighters worked to tackle the
OL,8,Ffire at its height. The building was
OL,9,Ffully evacuated and crews inside had to
OL,10,Fleave when the roof became unstable.
OL,11,FAll residents from the 32 flats remain
OL,12,Fout of their homes.
OL,14,FDorset Police said the woman, arrested
OL,15,Fon suspicion of arson with intent to
OL,16,Fendanger life, remained in police
OL,17,Fcustody.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
